   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>Consider the following statements regarding solar cell :<br />\n(i) The short circuit current <img align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" src=\"media/88/8884470f6cef4a87b38c.png\" /> is proportional to the light intensity.<br />\n(ii) Increase in doping causes rise in open circuit voltage (<em>V<sub>OC</sub></em>).<br />\n(iii) The solar cell material should have a large carrier diffusion length.<br />\nWhich of the above statements are correct?</p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
