   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +2 / -0",
   "html": "<p>A <em>n</em><sup>+</sup> polysilicon gate n-channel MOS transistor is made on a <em>p</em>-type Si substrate with <em>N<sub>a</sub></em> = 5 × 10<sup>15</sup> cm<sup>–3</sup>. The SiO<sub>2</sub> thickness is 100 <img align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" src=\"media/1d/1dfa0705f75f26b2f3da.png\" /> in the gate region and the work-function difference between gate and the bulk semiconductor is –0.95 V. Choose the correct statement(s).</p>\n\n<div> </div>\n\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"media/bd/bd887f290d2c4d4ba238.png\" /></div>",
