   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +1 / -0",
   "html": "<p>At 300 K, a solar cell has a reverse saturation current density <em>J<sub>o</sub></em> = 10<sup>–7</sup> A/m<sup>2</sup> and short circuit current density of 124 A/m<sup>2</sup>. Then the open-circuit voltage of the solar cell is ____ × 10<sup>–3</sup> V.</p>\n\n<div> </div>\n\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"media/d2/d27fd3c61995d4ad3f78.png\" /></div>",
