   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +2 / -0",
   "html": "<p>Consider a <em>p</em>-type silicon substrate of an MOS capacitor using aluminium gate with acceptor<br />\nconcentration of 10<sup>14</sup> cm<sup>–3</sup>. The value of oxide charge <em>Q</em>′<em><sub>ss</sub></em> = 10<sup>10</sup> cm<sup>−2</sup> , oxide thickness <img align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" src=\"media/9b/9bb23809c5808d741505.png\" /><br />\nand <img align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" src=\"media/bb/bb1a31ce8a56357c22a9.png\" /> = –0.83 V. The value of threshold voltage is equal to ______V.</p>\n\n<p>(Assume <em>V<sub>T</sub></em> = 26 mV, <em>n<sub>i</sub></em> = 1.5 × 10<sup>10</sup> cm<sup>–3</sup>, ∈<em><sub>ox</sub></em> = 3.9∈<em><sub>0</sub></em>, ∈<em><sub>Si</sub></em> = 11.7∈<sub>0</sub>)</p>",
